 "caption": "Don't drop the brake. Release it. 🏁\nTrail braking keeps load on the front tyres while you turn in. Save this for your next session.\n\n@akki_meister\n#simracing #simracer #f1sim #motorsport #simracingindia #akkimeister #racecraft #trailbraking #simracingtips #drivercoaching\n\n---\nAlternatives:\n- The brake release is where the corner is won. 🏎️ @akki_meister #simracing #trailbraking #racecraft #simracingtips\n- Stomp, then let go? That's why your car understeers. @akki_meister #simracing #trailbraking #learntodrive\n\n---\nSources (fact check):\n- Trail braking: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trail_braking\n- Weight transfer, sudden release unsettles the car, faster corners release earlier: https://www.carthrottle.com/post/how-to-trail-brake-and-why-itll-make-you-a-faster-driver/"
